			"Message": "style(Echo): Normalize spacing in Funding & Acknowledgements header\n\nRemove the HTML entity `&#x2001;` (thin space) preceding the '🙏🏻' emoji in the 'Funding & Acknowledgements' section of README.md. Retain standard ASCII spacing for the ampersand to ensure consistent rendering across Markdown parsers and code editors.\n\nThis minor cleanup aligns the header formatting with the project's visual documentation standards without altering the semantic content or acknowledgements.",
